e villain in  particular proclaims that the sacrifices  of the heroes will be in vain this is  the villain who was responsible for the  death of midnight and he tells mina and  the other students that this is the time  of liberation and those who stand  against liberation will be run down into  the ground  just like midnight was  mina instantly looks at the villain as  if to say say that one more time mother  but that's when our boy kirishima shows  up kirishima says that everyone has been  evacuated from the area which means that  the heroes can now go all out against  the villains a fierce-looking kirishima  says that todoroki just showed them how  manly he was and now it's time for them  to do their part mina was clearly upset  when the villain mentioned midnight but  kirishima showed up and got her back on  track we gotta remember that when they  were kids mina was the one whom  kirishima looked to for inspiration and  leadership and he himself lacked  confidence  but this time he was the one who kept  her from losing her cool and helped her  stay focused on the mission i honestly  love these two i love their history and  their relationship and i'm a big  minishima shipper we also get to see  that up in the flying ua bakugo is not  even surprised to hear that shoto won  and i'm sure that bakugou will be  looking to one-up shoto at some point  during the war because that's just how  bakugou is meanwhile fat gum and aoyama  are confronted by a villain who can  control plants i guess this guy is a  tartarus skp by the name of kinieda and  he says that he is all for one's latest  assassin having replaced dictator he  tells aoyama that no one has dared to  lie to olfa 1 and lived to tell the tale  implying that aoyama is about to die  aoyama responds by saying thank you in  french for some reason and then the  focus switches to spinner it appears  that spinner was given extra quirks by  all for one including at least one that  allowed him to increase his size until  