 has a flame around it another  has drills a third has curved blades a  fourth has black sludge and a fifth has  like a tiny human face coming out of it  because i guess all for one found a  philosopher's stone from fullmetal  alchemist or something and that is how  the chapter ends with all for one trying  to rattle endeavor mentally before  taking him on in battle and with the  text on the final page declaring that  despite the hero's plan all for one  remains as calm as ever wow this sure  was creepy and all for one really is a  villain that you cannot underestimate i  mean yes he got tricked by aoyama and  the heroes but he doesn't seem concerned  at all and he's always ready with some  sort of backup plan no matter what the  heroes throw his way it's going to be  very interesting to see just what insane  quirk combo all for one is about to  unleash upon the top two pro heroes okay  now back to the dobby glowing chest  thing to me this indicates that all for  one jammed a second quirk into dobby  likely against dobby's will because i do  believe that dobby wanted to beat both  shoto and endeavor using his own quirk  alone the big question is what is this  second quirk is it something that would  allow dabi to recover and keep fighting  or is it the same type of  self-destruction quirk that offer one  had used on lady nagant back in chapter  315 when lady nagant explodes in that  chapter we don't actually see her chest  so we don't know if there was a similar  effect going on we just see that the  rest of her body begins to like glow and  crack right before she explodes it is  possible that this glow in dobby's chest  is the beginning of the self-destruct  quirk activating and if that is the case  then considering the shape that dobby is  in right now i can't picture him  surviving this dobie is in way worse  shape right now than lady nagant was  before the explosion so if he really  explodes right now he will likely die  although he will probably take some  heroes down with him i don't think that  shoto will die after everything he's  just been through but a notable hero  like burn and might even though i  obviously do not want another waifu to  be harmed you come to 9211 ocean view  drive that's my home address and i will  knife fight you horikoshi my man ida is  right there like no offense either but  if i have to choose between you and  bernie i'm choosing vernon what do you  guys think is the light on dobby's chest  a sign that a second quirk is activating  within him or is it something that is  part of his own quirk like maybe his own  quirk is awakening if this is a second  quirk what do you think it is and could  it be  self-destruction definitely share your  thoughts down below because i need to  see some great theories about this being  discussed in the comments since dobby  was already a ticking time bomb due to  his obsession with endeavour and shoto i  wouldn't be surprised if all for one  secretly infused him with  self-destruction but we'll have to wait  and see i am extremely excited to see  what happens next and what kind of  situation deku will walk into once he  finally makes it back to shore for all  we know a bunch of heroes could be dead  by the time deku arrives and that would  absolutely destroy him emotionally but  it would also motivate him to absolutely  crush the villains if you guys enjoyed  this video you know what to do just  leave a quick like and comment it only  takes a second but it really helps me  out and remember that subscribing and  hitting that notification bell is a very  real way of directly supporting the  channel and of course it's completely  free you can also hit me up on twitter  and instagram at animeopror i want to  give a big thank you to all of our anime  outpour patrons for making videos like  this one possible special thank you to  kyle salisbury this man is an absolute  mad lad and a disciple of lord twego  himself and i can't forget all of our  the one tier patrons the